  m_Name: Glasshouse Cell Config 3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  CellName: Glasshouse
  Description: 'Meadow - intensity 3 of Glasshouse: twelve grazers and less room - tending and raiding
    both matter. The standard 1200 u cell with its nucleus (~392 u). No environment and
    NOTHING planted wild - every plant is an Angler''s seed, cacti at 1.4x leaf, up to 24
    plants between every colour (160 prisms, ~32,928 volume each at maturity). 12 tameable
    tadpoles graze every garden outside the nucleus; 3 omni crystals respawn inside it (the
    scene''s CrystalManager). Frenzy sits 25% above the full arena (5,897 prisms, 959,986
    volume). Authored by Tools/Build/author_glasshouse_assets.py - re-run it rather than
    hand-editing.'
